Note: Flow Standard Library
Note: This file defines all built-in functions as internal procedures
Note: The C# implementations are linked at runtime

use "@collections"
use "@bars"

internal proc print (String: s)
Note: Phase 44 Plan 44-08 — Void-wildcard print overload for the pre-strict
Note: bug fix per ROADMAP line 404. (print 42) charitably auto-strs in
Note: non-strict; emits [strict] (print) requires String — got <Type>
Note: in strict files. The String overload above scores +1000 vs this
Note: wildcard's +500 so (print "hello") stays byte-identical.
internal proc print (Void: s)

Note: Nothing() returns Void. Use as `return (Nothing)` to explicitly
Note: return Void from a proc that would otherwise collect non-void
Note: expressions before its end. There is no Void literal in source;
Note: this is the canonical escape hatch.
internal proc Nothing ()

