Note: Phase 44 Plan 44-08 — Void-wildcard if for non-strict truthy-coerce
Note: (if 5 ...) / (if "" ...). Strict (CallerStrictMode==true) emits
Note: [strict] (if) requires Bool — got <Type>. Existing Bool-Lazy and
Note: Bool-Void overloads score +1000 for the Bool case.
internal proc if (Void: cond, Void: if_true, Void: otherwise)
internal proc and (Lazy<Bool>: left, Lazy<Bool>: right)
internal proc and (Bool: left, Bool: right)
Note: Phase 44 Plan 44-08 — D-12 last-truthy and (composer Area 4.2 choice).
Note: (and 1 "foo") → "foo"; (and false 1) → false. Bool-Bool overload above
Note: wins +1000 for the Bool case so existing call sites are byte-identical.
internal proc and (Void: left, Void: right)

internal proc or (Lazy<Bool>: left, Lazy<Bool>: right)
internal proc or (Bool: left, Bool: right)
Note: Phase 44 Plan 44-08 — D-12 last-truthy or. (or false 42) → 42;
Note: (or "" "fallback") → "fallback".
internal proc or (Void: left, Void: right)

Note: Phase 44 Plan 44-08 — (not) FIRST registration per RESEARCH A6.
Note: Non-strict charitable truthy: (not 0) → true, (not "x") → false.
Note: Strict emits [strict] (not) requires Bool — got <Type>.
