Note: Quantize — snaps note onsets to a grid at the requested resolution.
Note: strength=0 short-circuits to identity; swing -1..1 signed offbeat shift.
internal proc quantize (Sequence: seq, NoteValue: resolution, Double: strength, Double: swing)

Note: Articulation transforms
Note: legato extends each note's rendered duration by overlap factor (1 + overlap), without
Note: moving onsets — polyphonic mix in the renderer handles the additive overlap.
Note: portamento emits MIDI CC65/CC5 bracket per note (audio renderer ignores; MIDI-only).
internal proc legato (Sequence: seq, Double: overlap)
internal proc portamento (Sequence: seq, Millisecond: glideTime)

