Note: Scala .scl tuning loader
Note: (loadScala "path.scl") parses the .scl + synthesizes a default linear KBM.
Note: (loadScala "path.scl" "path.kbm") loads both files together; fires the unmapped-
Note: key WarnOnce advisory once per Description if any `x` mapping entries are present.
internal proc loadScala (String: sclPath)
internal proc loadScala (String: sclPath, String: kbmPath)

Note: SFZ orchestral sampler loader
Note: Forward-declared in std.flow so the SfzEnabled gate fires at the
Note: runtime call site, not at parse-resolution. WITHOUT `use "@sfz"`, calling
Note: (loadSfz #violin) reaches the C# builtin and throws "loadSfz requires `use \"@sfz\"`"
Note: (the gate's whole point — the composer gets a clear "you forgot the import" message,
Note: not the generic "Function not found"). WITH `use "@sfz"`, the gate flips true and
Note: the lookup + parse + return path runs normally.
internal proc loadSfz (Symbol: name)
internal proc loadSfz (String: path)
